1
00:06:13,333 --> 00:06:19,333
Addicted to one-night stands or dependent on one another?

2
00:12:26,666 --> 00:12:32,666
Love & Other Drugs is a drama, comedy, romance film directed by Edward Zwick.

3
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:46,000
Maggie is an alluring free spirit who won't let
anyone – or anything – tie her down.

4
00:24:53,333 --> 00:24:59,333
But she meets her match in Jamie, whose relentless and nearly infallible charm serves
him well with the ladies and the cutthroat world of pharmaceutical sales.

5
00:31:06,666 --> 00:31:12,666
Maggie and Jamie's evolving relationship takes them both by surprise, as they
find themselves under the influence of the ultimate drug: love.

6
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:26,000
Jamie Randall, played by Jake Gyllenhaal.

7
00:43:33,333 --> 00:43:39,333
Maggie Murdock, played by Anne Hathaway.

8
00:49:46,666 --> 00:49:52,666
Bruce Winston, played by Oliver Platt.

9
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
Dr. Stan Knight, played by Hank Azaria.

10
01:02:13,333 --> 01:02:19,333
Josh Randall, played by Josh Gad.

11
01:08:26,666 --> 01:08:32,666
Trey Hannigan, played by Gabriel Macht.

12
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:46,000
Love & Other Drugs is a 2010 American romantic comedy drama film directed, produced and co-written by Edward Zwick
and based on Jamie Reidy's 2005 non-fiction book Hard Sell: The Evolution of a Viagra Salesman.

13
01:20:53,333 --> 01:20:59,333
Starring Jake Gyllenhaal, Anne Hathaway, Oliver Platt, Hank Azaria, Josh Gad and Gabriel Macht, the film tells the story of a
medicine peddler in 1990s Pittsburgh who starts a relationship with a young woman suffering from Parkinson's disease.

14
01:27:06,666 --> 01:27:12,666
Love & Other Drugs premiered at the AFI Fest on November 4, 2010 and was
released in theaters on November 24, 2010, by 20th Century Fox.

15
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
It grossed $105 million against a $30 million budget,
and received mixed reviews from critics.

16
01:39:33,333 --> 01:39:39,333
The film explores themes of letter, sexual freedom, love, viagra, free spirit.

17
01:45:46,666 --> 01:45:52,666
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
